.vscode
build*
build/
_build/
bk/
photo
test/photo*
test/scene/*
backups/*
**secret*
.claude/
# Screenshots are documentation, not credentials. Without these two lines an
# image whose file name contains "secret" - 3_cloud_brick_secret_id.png - stays
# out of the repository, so it builds on the machine that has the file and
# fails everywhere else.
!**/img/**
!**/*.png
